 "synopsis": "Global private equity firm Advent International has agreed to invest Rs 3,150 crore through primary capital for a 24.9% stake in Yatharth Hospital and Trauma Care Services. The investment will accelerate the Noida-based hospital chain's expansion and strengthen its healthcare network across North India. Following the transaction, the promoter Tyagi family will remain the company's largest shareholder. The transaction is subject to customary closing conditions.",
